<p>Detect the mental activity of creatures in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100,<br>mindpower 100">12, 13, 13, 14, 15</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 8, 9, 10, 12</acronym> turns.</p><p>This reveals their location and boosts your defense by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100,<br>mindpower 100">22, 30, 36, 41, 46.</acronym></p><p>The defense scales with you Mindpower and the range with your Willpower.</p>